              "type": "text",
              "content": "bar graphs",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " can help us to quickly understand and interpret information, such as the highest value, the comparison of values of different categories, etc. However, when the amount of data is large, presenting it by a pictograph is not only time consuming but at times difficult too. Let us"
